Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop Episode 10 -
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:10.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Did you bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:11.99,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.19,0:00:17.61,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My tooth feels loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:18.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop touching it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:20.94,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.29,0:00:25.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's probably a permanent tooth growing in. Just leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.79,0:00:29.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Should I make your rice into porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:32.66,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'll be fine if I eat slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:07.85,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:07.85,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:19.91,Bl1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(661,306)}Culture
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.94,0:02:19.91,Bl2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(656,479)}Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.79,MainLow,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.79,0:02:26.97,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.96,0:02:34.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.80,0:02:38.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's my drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.39,Kg1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(630,659)}m 0 0 l 350 0 350 78 0 78{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.39,Kg2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(753,659)}m 0 0 l 150 0 150 78 0 78{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.55,0:02:42.39,Kg3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(620,659)}Kaga  Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.43,0:02:46.14,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, does your dad always come to pick you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.14,0:02:49.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but he's not my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.29,0:02:51.05,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? He's not?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.64,0:02:55.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Great drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.87,0:02:56.89,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.89,0:03:00.40,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's the best at drawing in our B-Class!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:02.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:05.47,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you could become a manga artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:07.29,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.29,0:03:09.43,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:17.21,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.21,0:03:19.12,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.28,0:03:25.88,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:29.60,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This guy is her dad? He looks like a model.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.04,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,He's so handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.12,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,I like him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.10,0:03:37.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan's dad is the same age as you Daikichi, thirty-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:39.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.36,0:03:41.33,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.33,0:03:43.32,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,That's a pleasant coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.24,0:03:48.91,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,My dad's a model!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.91,0:03:50.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.70,0:03:52.66,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:56.63,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I did a little when I was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.54,0:04:02.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like I've seen you in my company's catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:05.01,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.80,0:04:09.51,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but if you don't mind,\Ncould you tell me your company's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.90,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, that must be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.24,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm indebted to your company!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.69,Overlap,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}He sure is chirpy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.69,0:04:20.80,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a manager at my agency now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.80,0:04:22.85,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.85,0:04:24.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That seems like a waste of your talents. {i.e. going from model to manager, i think}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.65,0:04:28.27,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I never knew how long I had to work until or when my next paycheck would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:30.91,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,so when my daughter was born, I stopped right then and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.41,0:04:38.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Meanwhile, I was getting drunk and whining about work every night.{\i0} {he's referring to what he used to do back then}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.84,Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Micchan! {funny anecdote, his name "Nabe-chin" means "hot pot"}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:43.20,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Nabe-chin! It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:47.53,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,He was in school with me.\NWe're both from the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.53,0:04:51.15,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,He's got a boy in A-Class.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:54.26,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,This is Daikichi-san, Rin-chan's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.27,0:04:55.77,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,He's the same age as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:57.98,Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Really? Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.98,0:05:00.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:04.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}These guys do everything for their kids.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:05.94,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:11.93,Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a butcher, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.93,0:05:13.61,Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,I've got a shop at the corner of the shopping mall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.61,0:05:16.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Rin and I always eat croquettes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.26,0:05:18.88,Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,Really? That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:19.99,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I do too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.99,0:05:21.85,Main,Nabe,0000,0000,0000,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.48,0:05:32.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Looks like I've made some new friends.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.89,0:06:05.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I feel like my life here is much more open.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:12.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.97,0:06:14.39,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:16.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It got cold all of sudden, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.94,0:06:20.90,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It did. The kids are already in the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.90,0:06:23.19,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I hope they have their jackets on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:28.28,Ni1,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(746,643)}m 0 0 l 230 0 230 78 0 78{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:28.28,Ni2,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\p1\pos(506,617)}m 0 0 l 250 0 250 78 0 78{\p0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:28.28,Ni3,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(498,617)}Nitani
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:28.28,Ni4,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(730,645)}Kouki
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.29,0:06:28.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, his drawing's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.28,0:06:30.19,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:32.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it looks like he really thought it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:40.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, all the kids are in the gym already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.70,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.70,0:06:46.03,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Shoot! Sensei's gonna be mad at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.74,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Boys are hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.72,0:06:51.47,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,So cute! How old is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:54.01,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Almost ten months.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.09,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Babies are so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.69,0:07:00.66,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,This brings back memories!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.94,0:07:06.98,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And then my kid got the flu last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:09.63,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really? That's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.63,0:07:11.31,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Is it that time of the year?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.31,0:07:13.99,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,They have to rest for two days even if the fever goes down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.99,0:07:14.88,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Or it'll spread.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:20.08,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I sent mine to school as soon as the fever dropped. {do i sense a flu epidemic at the school : ( }
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:21.89,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's understandable.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.89,0:07:23.71,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You wouldn't want to lose your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:28.10,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Plus, since he felt better, the virus must have been weakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:29.24,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:33.83,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, even if he did infect someone, no one would know it was him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.16,0:07:39.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.80,0:07:53.89,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I actually understood where those mothers were coming from,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.89,0:07:57.40,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,which makes me feel even more down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:08:01.62,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,She had a point about losing her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:03.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:08.20,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Whenever the weather turns cold, I lose my grip on things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.20,0:08:10.57,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But Kouki just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.57,0:08:13.22,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Put on your pajamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:21.99,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But when winter fades away and spring comes, I can start breathing easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.93,0:08:24.84,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.27,0:08:33.24,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm getting my knapsack, so wait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:35.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How dumb are you two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:36.24,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.24,0:08:39.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to wear your jackets in the gym! It's cold in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.52,0:08:40.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And don't run in the hallways!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.92,0:08:42.17,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.91,0:08:45.28,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I just said don't run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's teeth are already growing in, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.21,0:08:54.67,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, but because we live in an apartment building,\Nwe can't throw his teeth onto the roof for good luck. {in Japan they throw the baby teeth onto the roof so the new teeth grow in normally, like a charm}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.67,0:08:58.50,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,He doesn't really listen to what I say anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.50,0:09:02.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can relate to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:04.68,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I would wear the bare minimum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:07.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I would sprint down stairs two steps at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.48,0:09:10.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I would finish my lunch and a glass of milk without stopping to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:16.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't feel right warning kids not to do the same things I used to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.12,0:09:19.02,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Did you really do all of that, Daikichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:21.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think that's pretty common for boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.87,0:09:25.72,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Although I don't think of Kouki as just some random kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.83,0:09:28.74,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:32.33,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that if you were once like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:34.75,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,then I can rest easy a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:44.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing? Walk with Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.82,0:09:45.93,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:49.52,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's split into a boy's team and a girl's team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:50.65,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:54.96,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't Rin-chan's face a little flushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.66,0:10:02.40,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I think she has a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.62,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It might go up. {fever temperature}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:13.12,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}She's way more flushed than usual!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:25.40,Main,Doc,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't have the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:29.31,Main,Doc,0000,0000,0000,,Please have all those at home\Nwear masks for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.30,0:10:31.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.40,0:10:34.82,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.22,0:10:42.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:46.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're done already?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:49.87,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, my throat doesn't feel good. {i know "well" is correct, but she's a kid etc. feel free to change}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.87,0:10:54.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said it's the stomach bug, so don't force yourself to eat.{TLC: huh? Doc said she doesn't have the flu...}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.55,0:10:58.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.11,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get the wash basin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.20,0:11:24.47,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan has a what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.47,0:11:26.17,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Call an ambulance right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.17,0:11:29.64,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I already took her to a doctor and got medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:31.41,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but she won't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:33.68,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't look well and her fever keeps rising.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:36.16,MainLow,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't make her wear a jacket, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.15,0:11:38.09,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That doesn't matter now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.93,0:11:41.12,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Did you try mixing the medicine into juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:44.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You used to drink it right away if it was mixed into something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:47.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:48.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:59.71,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Won't you take just a sip?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.69,0:12:00.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.53,0:12:03.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, just one sip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.87,0:12:09.54,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.40,0:12:39.66,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for coming this early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How's Rin-chan feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.54,0:12:43.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:44.08,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Can we see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:46.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.07,0:12:47.16,Overlap,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, what's up with your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:52.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't have the flu, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.83,0:12:55.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,go watch some TV, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:12:56.36,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:57.33,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And keep it down! {volume}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.70,0:13:03.75,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She fell asleep just before you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.47,0:13:13.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever keeps rising and she can't sleep that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.04,0:13:15.20,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's not sweating at all either.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.19,0:13:17.40,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Can she keep liquids down? {is she able to drink liquids}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.31,0:13:21.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I know I was supposed to at least give her a sports drink,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.96,0:13:24.32,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but she won't drink or eat anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.32,0:13:25.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.57,0:13:29.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.56,0:13:33.36,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You can't lose focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:40.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,As the adult, you have to stay calm and tell her it's going to be alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.54,0:13:45.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not easy. I've never seen Rin like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.13,0:13:47.88,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't think like that! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.88,0:13:50.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,When a child is in really bad shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.94,0:13:53.93,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,they need someone to stick by their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.35,0:14:02.14,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you're beside her, Rin-chan will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.81,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.95,0:14:12.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:14.57,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Your throat must be dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.25,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Would you like some ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.43,0:14:33.60,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Better?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.40,0:14:39.51,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It feels nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.51,0:14:41.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you're awake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.30,0:14:43.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I was in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:45.23,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:48.14,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:52.84,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You can have some more ice in a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.84,0:14:56.49,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Your stomach won't like it if you have all of it at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:57.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:05.59,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And there's something sweet and\Ndelicious waiting for you in the refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:07.86,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.42,0:15:17.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. You'll be late for work, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.24,0:15:19.63,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan's really trying her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:23.65,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,As long as you're beside her, she'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.65,0:15:26.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.78,0:15:29.61,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you too, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.61,0:15:30.98,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.28,0:15:40.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I'll probably have to take tomorrow off as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.25,0:15:42.25,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If you need me, just call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.25,0:15:43.83,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for troubling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:47.62,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.62,0:15:49.87,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Just leave things here to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.89,0:16:05.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Think you can eat a little?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.55,0:16:06.54,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.16,0:16:18.37,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can eat all the sweet food you want when you have a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.19,0:16:25.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll have it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.93,0:16:39.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You'll feel much better once you get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.01,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Why'd it have to be Rin?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:51.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I'd gotten it instead, none of this would have happened.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.77,0:16:52.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Damn it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:54.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Damn it!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.07,0:16:55.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,500)}{\i1}Damn it...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:16.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.83,0:17:19.70,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.70,0:17:21.07,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.27,0:17:31.27,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How are you feeling, Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.27,0:17:32.78,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Does it still feel bad anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:35.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.74,0:17:39.65,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make you some yummy rice porridge now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:59.03,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever's been rising since noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.03,0:18:00.23,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:03.76,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Even normal temperatures are lower in the morning and higher after noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.77,0:18:07.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But hers was over 39 degrees just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.50,0:18:10.23,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Now, put this in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.23,0:18:11.19,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.60,0:18:15.31,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.69,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:27.71,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.00,0:18:37.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.00,0:18:39.42,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I made enough for you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:44.09,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, Rin said she wants water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:45.69,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.05,0:18:53.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, stay in this room so you don't get sick too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.64,0:18:56.35,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't care if I get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.35,0:18:58.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You will if you actually do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.66,0:19:09.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.32,0:19:20.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Kouki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.74,0:19:24.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin can really relax when you're around, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.67,0:19:26.96,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.94,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Okay Rin-chan, try eating this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.36,0:19:41.35,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You'll like it. Kouki eats it too when he's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:43.86,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's a special porridge that makes you better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.03,0:19:46.82,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun has it too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.82,0:19:48.19,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.20,0:19:52.54,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Anytime he eats this, he feels better right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.05,0:20:05.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.77,0:20:13.77,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:29.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, you're better already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.87,0:20:31.14,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.12,0:20:33.87,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.77,0:20:52.97,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:29.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Could you say thanks to your mom for helping us out the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.49,0:22:31.12,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.12,0:22:34.08,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When she took care of Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.08,0:22:38.45,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Can I come home with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.45,0:22:40.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.00,0:22:43.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom's the only one who's allowed to take you home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.80,0:22:47.84,Main,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,But she's at home sleeping with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.84,0:22:50.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Seriously?!
